TEXT -96 -256 Left 2 ;Problem 1.2 - duality of AC circuits.  Top: V1 - L1 - (C3 || L2).  Bottom, the dual: I1 || C1 - L3 - C2.
TEXT -96 -224 Left 2 ;Series <-> parallel, L <-> C, V source <-> I source.  L1, L2 keep LTspice's default Rser = 1m; the dual of that is Rpar = 1/1m = 1k on C1, C2.
TEXT -96 640 Left 2 !.ac dec 1000 20 20k
TEXT -96 688 Left 2 ;Plot V(vout) and I(C2): the same curve.  Flat at 2*L2/(L1+L2) = 1.6 (4.1 dB), resonance at sqrt((1+L1/L2)/(L1 C3))/2pi = 3979 Hz, then -40 dB/decade.
